Exceptions

The MIT license above covers the scripts, configuration files and
documentation written for this project. It does not cover:

- Patches to other projects (build/kernel/*.patch, build/mesa/*.patch,
  build/kde/fixups/*.patch, build/bluetooth/*.patch). Each patch is a
  modification of, and is licensed under the same terms as, the project it
  applies to: Linux (GPL-2.0-only), Mesa (MIT), KWin / Kirigami /
  plasma-desktop (GPL / LGPL as stated in those projects), surface-rt-patches
  (as stated in that repository).
- build/gltest/captured/ and build/gltest/kwin/: shader sources captured at run
  time from KWin and Qt; they remain under their original projects' licenses.
- Anything fetched by fetch-sources.sh (upstream trees, including the NVIDIA
  nvflash binaries in fusee-tools), which keeps its own license.
